            } catch (err) {
              if (err.code === '23514' && err.constraint === 'units_position_check') invalidPosRejected = true;
            }
          });
```
Look at that! If it unexpectedly succeeded, we register both the fixture ID and the code in `testRegistry`, so it can never leak undetected!

